Flappy Bird assets — ws183-os
=============================

Graphics (CC0):
  - flappy_atlas.png — Yorokobi Games / Rene Breitinger
    https://opengameart.org/content/flappy-sprite-sheet-16x16
    Upscaled NN x3 → bird_1/2/3, pipe_top/bot (LVGL RGB565A8 in main/).
  - grass_dirt_16.png — OpenGameArt CC0 (ground tile)
    https://opengameart.org/sites/default/files/grass_dirt_16.png
  - Sky fill #4EC0CA procedural (classic Flappy cyan).

SFX (CC0):
  - Kenney Digital Audio (already in flappy_sfx.c). OGA 8-bit / 5-hit
    swap is optional follow-up.

NOT used:
  - Kenney Tappy Plane (rejected: not classic Flappy look)
  - MegaCrash / itch packs (login / $0 gate)

SPIFFS (firmware/assets/flappy/) keeps short-named sources + NOTICE only.
Runtime sprites are compiled into firmware/main/flappy_img.c — not SPIFFS.
